---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy | ZDentistry";
const description = "Privacy policy for ZDentistry dental clinic in Cuttack. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.";
---

<PageLayout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <section class="section bg-white">
    <div class="container-custom max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: February 2025</p>

      <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none space-y-8">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          At ZDentistry, we are committed to protecting the privacy and confidentiality of our patients and website visitors. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your personal information when you visit our website or use our dental services.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Name, phone number, email address, and other details you provide when booking an appointment or submitting our contact form.</li>
            <li><strong>Medical Information:</strong> Dental and medical history, treatment records, X-rays, and other clinical data necessary for providing dental care.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about how you interact with our website, including pages visited and time spent on the site.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Your information is used for the following purposes:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>To schedule and manage your dental appointments.</li>
            <li>To provide dental treatment and follow-up care.</li>
            <li>To communicate with you about your treatment, appointments, and clinic updates.</li>
            <li>To respond to your inquiries submitted through our contact form or WhatsApp.</li>
            <li>To improve our website and services.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">3. Protection of Medical Records</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            All patient medical records are maintained in strict confidence. We follow applicable Indian healthcare data protection regulations and best practices to ensure the security of your medical information. Access to patient records is limited to authorised dental professionals involved in your care.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">4. Information Sharing</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>With your explicit consent.</li>
            <li>With referring dental specialists or laboratories as required for your treatment.</li>
            <li>When required by law or legal proceedings.</li>
            <li>With service providers who help operate our website (e.g., hosting), bound by confidentiality agreements.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">5. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your browsing experience and analyse site traffic. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings. We do not use cookies to collect personally identifiable medical information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">6. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            Our website may contain links to third-party services such as Google Maps and WhatsApp. These services have their own privacy policies, and we are not responsible for their practices. We encourage you to review their policies before using those services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">7. Data Security</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            We implement appropriate technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">8. Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700">
            <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you.</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal and medical record-keeping requirements.</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent for non-essential communications at any time.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-secondary-900 mb-3">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-3 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-gray-700">
            <p class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">ZDentistry</p>
            <p>2B / 109, Near Jugal Kishore Park, CDA Sector-9, Cuttack, Odisha 753014</p>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+918984489929" class="text-primary hover:underline">+91 89844 89929</a></p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:zdentistrydentaloffice@gmail.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">zdentistrydentaloffice@gmail.com</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
